OL,3,GNEWSAStorm leaves homes without power
OL,4,Aand cars wrecked
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo has uprooted trees which
OL,7,Fhave smashed into cars and left tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of people without power as it
OL,9,Fblows across the North West.
OL,11,FSP Electricity North West said nearly
OL,12,F4,000 homes had been hit by power cuts.
OL,13,FMore than 500 homes were affected in
OL,14,FBlackpool and 200 in Wigan alone.
OL,16,FA family day race meeting at
OL,17,FMerseyside's Aintree racecourse has
OL,18,Fbeen cancelled, along with Visit
OL,19,FLiverpool's River of Light event.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
